; [NEEDS-TRANSLATION] Room PLATFORM-ROOM: ACTION PLATFORM-ROOM-F
(room PLATFORM-ROOM
  :description "At Platform"
  :ldesc "You stand before a low rock platform, more like an afterthought of
piled rocks or a glacial moraine than a work of artifice. You are
pushed against the pile by the crowd around you."
  :flags (ONBIT)

  ; --- Room ACTION Routine ---
  ; <ROUTINE PLATFORM-ROOM-F (RARG)
  ;   <COND
  ;       (<RARG? ENTER> % <IFSOUND
  ;         <SOUNDS ,S-DRONE ,S-START 6>>)
  ;       (<RARG? BEG> <COND
  ;         (<VERB? WALK> <COND
  ;           (<EQUAL? ,P-WALK-DIR ,P?UP> <TELL "You are prevented, as the crowd holds you back." CR>)
  ;           (ELSE <TELL
  ;             "The crowding is such that you can barely move, much less walk."
  ;             CR>)>)
  ;         (<P? LISTEN (<> NOISE)> <TELL "It sounds like supplication." CR>)
