  ;   <COND
  ;       (<RARG? LOOK> <TELL
  ;         "The steam pipe and coaxial cable turn upwards and disappear into the
  ;   ceiling here. The tunnel itself comes to an end in a grimy, damp, and
  ;   dripping triad of crumbling brick walls."> <COND
