; [NEEDS-TRANSLATION] Room YUGGOTH: ACTION RANDOM-YUGGOTH-F
(room YUGGOTH
  :description "Place"
  :ldesc "This is a place. Things move about on a broken, rocky surface.
Harsh sounds split the air. Something sticky grabs at your feet.
There is no color, everything is drained of brightness, dull and
lifeless. A path descends into a shallow bowl of black basalt."
  :flags (ONBIT)
  :exits
    (
      (down :to BOWL-ROOM)
    )

  ; --- Room ACTION Routine ---
  ; <ROUTINE RANDOM-YUGGOTH-F (RARG)
  ;   <COND
  ;       (<RARG? ENTER> % <IFSOUND
  ;         <SOUNDS
  ;           ,S-DRONE
  ;           ,S-START
  ;           <COND (<HERE? ,YUGGOTH> 2) (ELSE 4)>>> <QUEUE I-YUGGOTH 2>)>
  ; >
  ; --- End Room ACTION Routine ---
)

